### Smart Aquarium - REST API & WebSocket Test Requests
### Panduan:
### 1. Jalankan request Login untuk mendapatkan JWT token.
### 2. Salin token dari respon ke variabel @token di bawah.
### 3. Gunakan request lainnya dengan token tersebut.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = tempel_token_jwt_di_sini
@nodeId = aq-sim001

### 1. Health Check (Publik)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Login (Publik)
# Ganti username dan password dengan kredensial ADMIN_USERNAME & ADMIN_PASSWORD dari .env
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "ganti_dengan_ADMIN_PASSWORD"
}

###

### 3. Daftar Seluruh Node (Summary)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/nodes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Detail Node Spesifik
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/nodes/{{nodeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Ubah Nama Node (Rename)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/nodes/{{nodeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Akuarium Ruang Tamu"
}

###

### 6. Riwayat Telemetry (Rentang Waktu ISO 8601 UTC)
# Rentang <= 48 jam mengembalikan data mentah.
# Rentang > 48 jam mengembalikan data rata-rata per jam via date_bin.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/nodes/{{nodeId}}/telemetry?from=2026-11-06T00:00:00Z&to=2026-11-08T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. Ubah Mode Pengoperasian Node ('auto' atau 'manual')
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/nodes/{{nodeId}}/mode
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "manual"
}

###

### 8. Kendali Aktuator Manual (Hanya Diizinkan Pada Mode Manual)
# Mengembalikan 202 Accepted jika berhasil, atau 409 Conflict jika mode Auto.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/nodes/{{nodeId}}/actuators
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "heater": 0,
  "fan": 1,
  "pump": 0
}

###

### 9. Log Riwayat Aktuator dan Alert
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/nodes/{{nodeId}}/logs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 10. Perbarui Telegram Chat ID Pengguna
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/me/telegram
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "telegram_chat_id": "123456789"
}

###

### 11. WebSocket Connection (Browser / WS Client)
# Gunakan query param token:
# ws://localhost:8080/ws?token={{token}}
